      "text": "Language = the key issue:"
     },
     {
      "type": "text",
      "text": " families may be frustrated when a 2-yo cannot communicate her needs, but helping the child master the use of language = critical."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "paragraph",
    "attrs": {
     "indLeft": 18,
